  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">YAL - Rukwanzi - Nyunya</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Food Processing .Beneficiaries: YAL Youth 1025 of whom 413 are women. .Breakdown:.Suppliers/ distributors: 3.Volunteer Staff: 2.Additional Youth Jobs: 20.Current customer base: 1000 (60:40) ..The grant will be used to increase production and awareness of Nyunya Probiotic Yoghurt. This increase in distribution to a wider community will result in more sustained job growth as well as improved health through consumption. ..The grant funds will be used to: (a) improving infrastructure to increase production; (b) training on improving health standards and sales; (c) technical assistance on quality control; and (d) improved packing and safety gear. .</narrative>
  </description>
